/-- **MathDB #356988 — Conjecture 3.1 is FALSE.**  The roof vertex's backtracking PageRank
falls from `μ = 1/2` to `μ = 1` and rises again at `μ = 2`, so it is not monotonic.  Each
value is stated for EVERY solution of the defining system, and uniqueness makes that the
stationary vector. -/
theorem main :
    (∀ y, A_half *ᵥ y = b_half → y 10 + y 11 = (8356 / 47445)) ∧
    (∀ y, A_one *ᵥ y = b_one → y 10 + y 11 = (22 / 125)) ∧
    (∀ y, A_two *ᵥ y = b_two → y 10 + y 11 = (3134 / 17805)) ∧
    ((8356 / 47445) : ℚ) > (22 / 125) ∧ ((22 / 125) : ℚ) < (3134 / 17805) :=
  ⟨pi4_half, pi4_one, pi4_two, by norm_num, by norm_num⟩

